WEBVTT

00:09.267 --> 00:10.407
Barusu.

00:11.137 --> 00:12.807
How long do you intend to sleep?

00:12.807 --> 00:14.577
Wake up already, Barusu.

00:14.577 --> 00:16.827
Bororokka?!

00:17.577 --> 00:18.877
Where are we?

00:18.877 --> 00:21.277
The air is still and cool.

00:21.277 --> 00:23.297
We're most likely underground.

00:23.897 --> 00:25.247
Ram?

00:25.687 --> 00:27.257
You say we're underground?

00:27.787 --> 00:29.647
Beneath the dunes.

00:29.647 --> 00:33.417
If you believe what Lady Beatrice 
said before we were separated,

00:33.417 --> 00:35.637
it's probably because of 
a distortion in space.

00:35.637 --> 00:37.977
And that sent us flying?

00:38.487 --> 00:40.857
Wait, separated? That's right!

00:40.857 --> 00:42.577
Where are the others?

00:42.577 --> 00:44.987
Why is it just you and me here?

00:45.717 --> 00:47.197
You're asking me that?

01:04.787 --> 01:08.127
I don't see Lady Emilia or Lady Beatrice.

01:08.127 --> 01:09.817
You really blew it this time.

01:09.817 --> 01:11.657
Is this really the time for that?!

01:11.657 --> 01:13.257
We have to find the others...

01:13.257 --> 01:15.227
No, wait... Rem...

01:15.227 --> 01:15.937
Barusu.

01:16.497 --> 01:19.887
We need to find all of 
them, but Rem comes first!

01:19.887 --> 01:21.687
She can't even move on her own!

01:22.157 --> 01:24.447
We have to... We have to find her, quick!

01:24.447 --> 01:26.317
Barusu, calm down.

01:26.317 --> 01:29.537
Calm down?! You expect me to calm down?!

01:29.537 --> 01:32.067
Don't you even care that Rem's in danger?!

01:32.067 --> 01:33.537
You know I do!

01:37.577 --> 01:38.627
You're right.

01:38.627 --> 01:39.957
Sorry. I mean it.

01:40.857 --> 01:43.887
I was being dumb... and a total jerk.

01:45.167 --> 01:46.507
That's nothing new.

01:47.017 --> 01:49.387
Anyway, I can feel my faint link with Rem.

01:50.087 --> 01:52.257
I don't know where she is,

01:52.257 --> 01:54.347
but she's alive, at least.

01:54.347 --> 01:57.907
Oh, yeah!
The synesthesia you have as twins!

01:57.907 --> 02:00.477
I see ya woke up, Natsuki.

02:00.787 --> 02:03.567
Lady Anastasia and... Patrasche?

02:04.117 --> 02:06.647
Sorry I borrowed her without askin'.

02:07.127 --> 02:12.007
Even I didn't have the guts 
to go lookin' around alone.

02:12.007 --> 02:14.237
I mean, that's fine, but...

02:14.897 --> 02:18.237
I never said it was
just the two of us here.

02:18.237 --> 02:19.617
How did the surroundings look?

02:20.187 --> 02:24.337
Not good. I didn't see an exit 
or any of the others close by.

02:24.847 --> 02:28.167
Looks like only us three were sent here...

02:28.167 --> 02:30.717
Oh, and Patrasche, of course.

02:31.277 --> 02:32.977
Just us?

02:32.977 --> 02:34.557
No point in crying over it.

02:35.317 --> 02:37.867
Since the useless Barusu is awake now,

02:37.867 --> 02:40.267
let's go look for Rem and Lady Emilia.

02:40.557 --> 02:42.327
Look for them?

02:42.327 --> 02:45.207
I'm sensing some malice 
behind this team formation!

02:45.207 --> 02:48.027
None of us can fight!

04:20.647 --> 04:25.007
I think... I can feel a 
breeze... or maybe not...

04:27.107 --> 04:28.997
Can't you speak with spirits, Barusu?

04:28.997 --> 04:31.587
Lesser spirits to guide us, huh?

04:32.037 --> 04:37.297
Problem with that is, my link with Beako 
is so strong it scares lesser spirits.

04:37.697 --> 04:41.887
Well, you're only a half-baked magician 
born of Lady Beatrice's pity, after all.

04:42.207 --> 04:44.797
Don't worry. I had no expectations.

04:44.797 --> 04:46.147
Grr...

04:46.147 --> 04:47.277
Natsuki.

04:48.167 --> 04:50.537
She's trying bravely to hide it,

04:50.537 --> 04:54.697
but right after we were sent 
here, before you woke up,

04:55.047 --> 04:58.657
Ram was pretty distraught 'cause 
she didn't see Rem around.

04:58.657 --> 05:00.257
Really?

05:00.257 --> 05:04.867
So you're playin' a part in 
keepin' her emotionally stable.

05:05.417 --> 05:07.297
You ain't useless.

05:11.767 --> 05:13.257
The path splits here.

05:13.707 --> 05:16.717
As if it's telling us to 
agonize over the choice.

05:16.717 --> 05:17.837
What do we do?

05:17.837 --> 05:19.417
Based on the knowledge I have,

05:19.417 --> 05:22.407
Freud said that in times like 
this, you always go right.

05:22.407 --> 05:23.557
Who even is that?

05:23.557 --> 05:27.767
Apparently, behavioral studies suggest 
that humans tend to choose the left.

05:28.197 --> 05:32.367
So my sense of justice tells 
me to check the right!

05:32.367 --> 05:34.767
You really trust this Freud a lot.

05:34.767 --> 05:36.587
Again, who even is that?

05:52.767 --> 05:53.957
A door?

05:54.647 --> 05:56.807
It's huge, and it looks thick.

05:56.807 --> 05:58.307
Can we move it?

05:58.307 --> 06:02.137
I think that'll be tough.
Looks like it's completely sealed.

06:02.137 --> 06:03.927
Although, Natsuki...

06:04.317 --> 06:06.767
why do ya think this is a door?

06:07.307 --> 06:10.867
It just looks like an iron wall to me.

06:10.867 --> 06:11.487
Huh?

06:11.487 --> 06:12.227
Agreed.

06:12.837 --> 06:15.357
It just looks like a pile of 
iron scrap blocking my path.

06:15.767 --> 06:20.067
W-Well... I just thought it 
kinda looked like a door...

06:23.447 --> 06:24.287
Huh?

06:27.557 --> 06:28.427
Eh?

06:28.427 --> 06:29.997
What was that?

06:29.997 --> 06:32.157
Natsuki, did you do somethin'?

06:32.157 --> 06:34.717
Did I... You were watching, weren't you?

06:34.717 --> 06:36.457
I only touched it!

06:36.457 --> 06:37.767
I didn't do anything.

06:37.767 --> 06:40.047
I don't know what happened, either.

06:40.047 --> 06:40.977
Let's go.

06:42.517 --> 06:43.387
Patrasche?

06:45.927 --> 06:49.677
I know you're trying to protect us.

06:49.677 --> 06:53.097
But in the situation we're 
in, nowhere is safe.

06:53.097 --> 06:55.567
We need to be prepared to 
take risks at some point,

06:56.067 --> 06:57.737
and now is that time.

07:01.027 --> 07:02.407
She's got you whipped.

07:02.997 --> 07:06.247
If there's gotta be whipping 
between me and a woman,

07:06.247 --> 07:08.657
I'd rather be the one to be whipped.

07:08.657 --> 07:09.427
Pervert.

07:09.427 --> 07:11.287
I didn't mean it that way!

07:17.557 --> 07:19.587
That's two of them.

07:19.587 --> 07:21.467
And this one just vanished, too.

07:22.267 --> 07:26.177
What's the point in walls that 
don't stop anyone's progress?

07:26.807 --> 07:27.707
What is it?

07:27.707 --> 07:32.417
Well, we haven't seen any yet, 
so it might be hard to imagine,

07:32.417 --> 07:35.537
but maybe they're meant
to keep mabeasts out.

07:35.537 --> 07:40.107
There's a chance that this could be 
connected to a sandworm's tunnel, too.

07:40.107 --> 07:42.567
They may be intended to keep 
only mabeasts from passing.

07:42.567 --> 07:46.277
Yikes. If that's what it 
is, that's terrifying.

08:03.787 --> 08:06.717
Does anyone else feel weirdly heavy?

08:10.177 --> 08:13.737
But I guess this isn't
the time for whining.

08:13.737 --> 08:15.477
It's a little hard to walk,

08:16.147 --> 08:18.257
but it's no big deal.

08:18.257 --> 08:20.907
If we keep up this pace, our 
goal might be closer than we—

08:20.907 --> 08:21.687
Barusu.

08:22.087 --> 08:23.287
Shut up.

08:23.287 --> 08:25.027
Uh... Oh, right...

08:25.027 --> 08:29.487
But it seems so boring to just keep quiet.

08:29.997 --> 08:32.287
You think we're walking for fun?

08:32.287 --> 08:33.927
Remember our objective.

08:33.927 --> 08:34.887
Well...

08:34.887 --> 08:36.957
Natsuki, that's enough.

08:37.637 --> 08:39.387
Look at our situation.

08:39.387 --> 08:41.587
When people are feelin' irritable,

08:41.587 --> 08:44.797
nothin' ya say to anyone
is gonna end well.

08:45.277 --> 08:46.027
Right?

08:56.897 --> 08:58.877
Damn it!

08:58.877 --> 09:01.117
After all this?! What the hell?!

09:01.117 --> 09:03.397
You let us pass through three doors!

09:03.397 --> 09:05.857
Why get in our way now?!

09:06.437 --> 09:09.807
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it all!

09:11.027 --> 09:13.957
Natsuki, that's enough.

09:13.957 --> 09:16.157
We've hit a dead end.

09:16.157 --> 09:20.127
I know that! I don't need you telling me!

09:26.707 --> 09:30.677
Hey. What the hell has your 
problem been all this time?

09:30.677 --> 09:31.927
Nothing.

09:31.927 --> 09:33.637
Nothing, my ass!

09:33.637 --> 09:36.207
I asked you what your damn problem is!

09:36.207 --> 09:39.257
I'm busting my ass here, and 
you keep clicking your tongue!

09:39.257 --> 09:40.887
I can hear you, you know!

09:40.887 --> 09:42.727
So what's your problem?! Huh?!

09:42.727 --> 09:43.437
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

09:43.437 --> 09:45.527
Just calm down, both of you!

09:45.527 --> 09:46.997
There's no need to get so—

09:46.997 --> 09:47.947
Shut the hell up!

09:48.367 --> 09:51.987
Can't you see Ram and I 
are talking right now?!

09:52.327 --> 09:55.897
Well, go on! If there's something 
you wanna say, let's hear it!

09:55.897 --> 09:57.927
I'm all ears!

09:57.927 --> 10:01.247
You're very eager to keep 
moving forward, aren't you?

10:01.567 --> 10:03.397
Damn straight I am!

10:03.397 --> 10:06.097
Why the hell do you think 
we've come this far?!

10:06.097 --> 10:07.927
So we can see the Sa—

10:06.707 --> 10:07.927
Wrong.

10:07.927 --> 10:10.497
We didn't come here to see the Sage.

10:10.497 --> 10:11.137
What?!

10:11.137 --> 10:14.507
We came here to wake Rem.

10:16.807 --> 10:20.327
I came here to remember my little sister.

10:20.327 --> 10:22.807
And yet what are we doing now?

10:23.527 --> 10:24.647
Rem isn't even here.

10:24.647 --> 10:26.997
We're just wandering aimlessly down here.

10:26.997 --> 10:28.457
Stop playing games.

10:28.457 --> 10:30.727
I'm not playing games!

10:30.727 --> 10:33.967
I can't help that we ended up here!

10:33.967 --> 10:35.827
When we fell down here,

10:35.827 --> 10:38.597
why did you grab me and not Rem?

10:40.037 --> 10:43.157
I'm sure all you could think about 
was what lay immediately ahead.

10:43.157 --> 10:44.537
You're always like that.

10:45.337 --> 10:48.617
All you ever think about is 
Lady Emilia and Lady Beatrice.

10:48.617 --> 10:50.417
What kind of man are you?

10:50.417 --> 10:51.927
I feel bad for Rem.

10:51.927 --> 10:52.677
Shut up.

10:53.007 --> 10:55.757
Didn't Rem believe in you?

10:55.757 --> 10:56.997
Shut up!

10:56.997 --> 10:58.307
No, I will not!

10:58.307 --> 11:01.767
You don't actually care 
about Rem at all, do you?!

11:01.767 --> 11:04.227
Cut the shit!

11:07.227 --> 11:09.677
Invisible Providence.

11:22.487 --> 11:24.247
Quit screwing with me!

11:24.247 --> 11:26.457
This is all your fault!

11:26.457 --> 11:29.667
Your fault! Your fault! Your fault!

11:30.487 --> 11:32.767
Just die, you bitch!

11:32.767 --> 11:38.547
It makes me sick to think that 
you look so much like Rem!

11:39.467 --> 11:42.137
What?! I can't hear you!

11:42.137 --> 11:45.827
If you've got something 
to say, say it so I can...

11:49.537 --> 11:50.067
...ra.

11:55.827 --> 11:57.327
Magic?!

11:57.327 --> 12:01.307
Look, bitch! It's too late to 
come crying and say you're sorry!

12:01.307 --> 12:03.497
That's my line.

12:04.487 --> 12:07.167
You don't deserve to see Rem.

12:07.167 --> 12:09.917
I'll slice you apart and 
leave you here to rot!

12:09.917 --> 12:11.167
Keep talking!

12:12.067 --> 12:14.057
All right, that's enough.

12:19.397 --> 12:21.327
There was no stoppin' you two,

12:21.327 --> 12:24.267
so I had to decide who'd be more useful.

12:24.267 --> 12:25.507
Do forgive me.

12:27.267 --> 12:29.317
Why... did you...

12:29.317 --> 12:32.777
What? <i>You're</i> askin' <i>me</i> that?

12:33.257 --> 12:37.617
I could see things were gonna 
end poorly, so I helped you.

12:38.207 --> 12:41.977
Or are you pissed 'cause 
I took your prey from you,

12:41.977 --> 12:43.857
and now you're comin' for me?

12:44.407 --> 12:48.217
Fine. I'll let you smooth talk me for now.

12:48.807 --> 12:51.277
That's the way.

12:53.327 --> 12:56.967
Very clever! I'm relieved!

12:57.717 --> 12:58.847
So here.

12:59.267 --> 13:03.057
A handshake to show we're gonna 
make up and play nice from now on.

13:04.767 --> 13:06.227
Natsuki?

13:06.967 --> 13:07.897
What's wrong?

13:09.187 --> 13:10.067
Oh...

13:11.267 --> 13:12.647
nothing.

13:16.407 --> 13:17.407
In that case...

13:33.847 --> 13:36.167
L-Let me go! Let me go!

13:38.007 --> 13:40.387
No! I don't wanna die!

13:40.387 --> 13:44.407
You're already dead! I can't help you!

13:44.407 --> 13:46.807
Damn it, you idiot!

13:46.807 --> 13:49.017
Just die already!

14:10.567 --> 14:13.747
Don't... leave... me...

14:22.927 --> 14:26.067
It's Ram... Ram's magic.

14:26.067 --> 14:29.107
That bitch... survived...

14:36.837 --> 14:38.237
Patrasche?

14:38.807 --> 14:40.947
You're alive?

14:41.677 --> 14:43.837
Is Ram dead?

14:44.717 --> 14:46.297
No, it doesn't matter.

14:46.297 --> 14:47.587
Let me ride you.

14:48.437 --> 14:51.007
Did you hear me?! Hey!

14:51.007 --> 14:53.337
Get over here, damn it!

14:53.337 --> 14:55.657
Who do you think I am?!

15:00.757 --> 15:03.167
Finally, you're listening...

15:31.827 --> 15:33.607
Barusu. Barusu.

15:34.257 --> 15:36.877
Wake up before I burn your eyelids off.

15:41.327 --> 15:42.217
I'm...

15:43.947 --> 15:44.757
Barusu?

15:47.667 --> 15:48.637
How pathetic.

15:49.907 --> 15:51.597
Don't bite me.

15:57.847 --> 16:00.197
Thanks. I'm okay now.

16:00.197 --> 16:03.567
Oh? Well, I'm glad you're happy now.

16:03.567 --> 16:05.547
Hey, come on...

16:05.547 --> 16:07.187
Oh, thank goodness!

16:07.187 --> 16:09.867
I see you're awake too, Natsuki.

16:10.257 --> 16:12.997
Thankfully. How did the surroundings look?

16:13.377 --> 16:17.987
Not good. I didn't see an exit 
or any of the others close by.

16:17.987 --> 16:18.747
Natsuki?

16:20.327 --> 16:21.587
What's wrong?

16:22.657 --> 16:26.017
Hey... just what is the miasma, exactly?

16:26.017 --> 16:26.687
Huh?

16:27.137 --> 16:29.847
This place is part of the dunes, right?

16:29.847 --> 16:32.707
And there's supposed to 
be miasma here, right?

16:32.707 --> 16:36.247
Miasma is, in essence, tainted mana.

16:36.247 --> 16:37.857
Tainted mana?

16:37.857 --> 16:42.437
They say if you get stuck in it, 
it'll eat away at your body and mind.

16:42.437 --> 16:43.767
Is there a way to fight it?

16:43.767 --> 16:48.767
Our gates take in mana by nature,

16:48.767 --> 16:54.147
so all we can really do is stay away 
from where the miasma's thickest.

16:56.347 --> 16:58.387
The miasma did that.

16:58.387 --> 17:01.117
So if we keep moving,
it'll happen again...

17:01.117 --> 17:02.087
No.

17:06.027 --> 17:06.887
Barusu?

17:07.317 --> 17:08.377
Let's go.

17:19.437 --> 17:21.827
Left. We'll go left.

17:26.087 --> 17:28.827
Lady Anastasia, the ceiling's low here.

17:28.827 --> 17:29.927
Be careful.

17:29.927 --> 17:32.407
Right, got it. Thank ya kindly.

17:32.737 --> 17:35.477
Ram, the footing's unstable here.

17:35.477 --> 17:36.797
Watch your step.

17:36.797 --> 17:38.367
Yes, understood.

17:38.367 --> 17:40.747
If you get cold, speak up.

17:40.747 --> 17:43.337
I'll lend you my cloak if you want it.

17:43.927 --> 17:46.997
Wh-What? What's wrong?

17:46.997 --> 17:48.237
That's my question.

17:48.237 --> 17:50.347
Why the creepy considerate act?

17:50.707 --> 17:52.287
What are you plotting?

17:52.287 --> 17:54.367
I'm not plotting anything!

17:54.367 --> 17:58.467
I just... want you both to 
stay healthy, that's all...

17:58.467 --> 17:59.307
Pervert.

17:59.307 --> 18:01.067
That's not perverted!

18:01.067 --> 18:03.777
How is this any different 
from how Julius acts?!

18:03.777 --> 18:06.837
Well, it's natural when Julius does it,

18:06.837 --> 18:09.927
but from you, it feels... 
sick? It's unnatural.

18:09.927 --> 18:11.197
Did you say "sick"?!

18:14.217 --> 18:16.697
Hey, do you smell somethin' funny?

18:17.437 --> 18:19.797
It smells like something is burning.

18:19.797 --> 18:20.577
A smell?

18:21.387 --> 18:22.677
I'll check it out.

18:24.597 --> 18:27.227
If anything happens,
we're leaving you as bait.

18:27.227 --> 18:28.457
Don't hold it against us.

18:28.457 --> 18:30.927
You know I'm gonna curse you if you do!

18:53.567 --> 18:55.237
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

19:55.077 --> 19:55.857
That idiot!

20:15.367 --> 20:16.677
El Fura!

20:19.577 --> 20:22.067
Get up! You want to make Rem cry?

20:23.287 --> 20:25.037
Don't you dare die, Barusu!

20:31.747 --> 20:34.467
Invisible Providence!

20:35.337 --> 20:36.967
El Fura!

20:44.797 --> 20:45.397
Barusu!

21:07.437 --> 21:08.877
Why...

21:10.567 --> 21:12.457
Because Rem would cry.

21:18.757 --> 21:20.307
Move, idiot!

21:20.807 --> 21:22.637
This is not the time to lie around!

21:26.347 --> 21:30.997
Get up! Get up, Subaru Natsuki!

21:47.597 --> 21:48.647
Ram!

22:07.977 --> 22:09.337
I found you.

22:07.977 --> 22:10.017
<b>The Keeper of the Watchtower</b>
